OL,3,ADavid Walliams accused of preying on
OL,4,Agirls as young as 15 after losing court
OL,5,Abattle to stop publication
OL,6,
OL,7,FWalliams had asked the High Court to
OL,8,Fblock the publication of the
OL,9,Finvestigation, and said if the
OL,10,Fallegations were made public it was
OL,11,F"highly likely" he would kill himself.
OL,12,FThe court refused the request, saying
OL,13,Fthe risks could be mitigated
OL,15,FOn Tuesday, a minister said the
OL,16,Fgovernment was "concerned" at the use
OL,17,Fof media injunctions
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
